%%{init:{"theme":"neutral"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Lead Auditor
  participant W as Web UI
  participant API as NestJS API
  participant DB as Postgres (RLS)
  participant L as Audit Ledger
  participant LLM as LLM Provider

  A->>W: Create engagement (mode, scope)
  W->>API: POST /v1/engagements
  API->>DB: INSERT engagement row
  API->>L: Emit engagement.created event (signed)
  L-->>API: seq + signature
  API-->>W: 201 engagement

  A->>W: Start interview session
  W->>API: POST /v1/interviews (live)
  API->>LLM: Generate opening questions (tier: medium)
  LLM-->>API: Question set (draft)
  API->>L: Emit interview.started (signed)
  API-->>W: Session token + questions

  A->>W: Record answer; request attribution
  W->>API: POST answer chunk
  API->>LLM: Attribute to clause (tier: medium)
  LLM-->>API: Clause refs + confidence
  API->>DB: Upsert claim rows (bi-temporal)
  API->>L: Emit answer.attributed (signed)
  API-->>W: Attribution + coverage delta

  A->>W: Confirm attribution (auditor gate)
  W->>API: PATCH claim (auditor_confirmed=true)
  API->>L: Emit claim.confirmed (signed)
  API-->>W: Updated coverage

  A->>W: Promote candidate finding
  W->>API: POST /candidate-findings/:id/promote
  API->>DB: INSERT formal finding
  API->>L: Emit finding.promoted (signed)
  API-->>W: Finding record
